      "change": "Independent audit 2026-10-02 (MAJOR 1): configuration validation rejects a preprocessing sensitivity whose model_id is the role=primary model (E_SENSITIVITY_PRIMARY_MODEL, exit 2), so an imputed matrix can never feed the primary fit."
