    {
      "id": "A-2026-10-01-11",
      "adr": "docs/adr/0008-independent-audit-fixes.md",
      "paths": [
        "src/proteomics_pipeline/runtime.py",
        "tests/contract/foundation/test_cli_contract.py",
        "tests/contract/foundation/test_verify_contract.py"
      ],
      "change": "Portability fixes from the first real CI run (36982402784, V107 FAIL). runtime.run_r_code runs R snippets from a UTF-8 script file instead of `Rscript -e`, passes forward-slash path arguments and decodes as UTF-8. runtime.child_environment forces a UTF-8 locale for R children on POSIX. The CLI contract finds console scripts through sysconfig. Explicit encoding='utf-8' was added mechanically to every text-mode open/read_text/write_text/subprocess call across src/, tests/ and scripts/maintained/ (each file stays in its owning packet; behaviour is unchanged on UTF-8 platforms), and a lint test enforces it."
